From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Juanesf <juanesf91@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 32/32] clk: sunxi: a733: enable CE auxiliary clocks

Enable the MBUS and system clocks used by CE v5 on A733.

Signed-off-by: Juanesf <juanesf91@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 drivers/clk/sunxi/clk_a733.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/clk/sunxi/clk_a733.c b/drivers/clk/sunxi/clk_a733.c
--- a/drivers/clk/sunxi/clk_a733.c
+++ b/drivers/clk/sunxi/clk_a733.c
@@ -61,6 +61,8 @@ static struct ccu_clk_gate a733_gates[] = {
 	[CLK_LRADC]		= GATE(0x1024, BIT(0)),
 	[CLK_CE]		= GATE(0x0ac0, BIT(31)),
 	[CLK_BUS_CE]		= GATE(0x0ac4, BIT(0)),
+	[CLK_MBUS_CE]		= GATE(0x05e4, BIT(2)),
+	[CLK_CE_SYS]		= GATE(0x0ac4, BIT(1)),
 
 	/* Display clocks */
 	[CLK_PLL_VIDEO0]	= GATE(0x0120, BIT(31)),
-- 
